OrangutanAdventureSumatra redesign

Modern Next.js landing and booking website based on content from:
https://www.orangutanadventuresumatra.com/

Run locally:

1. npm run build
2. npm run start -- --hostname 127.0.0.1 --port 3000

Sharing and routes:

- Localized pages: /en, /de, /fr, /nl
- Essential information page: /essential-information
- Privacy policy page: /privacy
- Travel blog index and articles: /blog
- Sitemap: /sitemap.xml
- Robots: /robots.txt
- AI crawler summary: /llms.txt
- Link preview image: public/images/link-preview.jpg
- Regenerate link preview: npm run preview-image

Google Places reviews:

1. Enable Places API in Google Cloud and make sure billing is enabled.
2. Copy .env.example to .env.local.
3. Fill GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY and GOOGLE_PLACE_ID.
4. Start the site and check /api/reviews. If configured correctly, the homepage testimonial section will show up to 3 Google reviews with 5 stars and comments. Profile photos appear automatically when Google returns profile_photo_url.

Review display settings:

- GOOGLE_PLACES_REVIEW_DISPLAY_LIMIT controls cards shown on the homepage.
- GOOGLE_PLACES_REVIEW_MIN_TEXT_LENGTH filters reviews that are too short for the card layout.
- GOOGLE_PLACES_REVIEW_MAX_TEXT_LENGTH truncates long Google reviews before they reach the UI.
- GOOGLE_PLACES_REVIEWS_SORT defaults to most_relevant.
- GOOGLE_PLACES_REVIEWS_CACHE_SECONDS defaults to 86400.

Booking email:

- The booking form sends mail through Zoho SMTP.
- Use smtp.zoho.com for free/personal accounts or smtppro.zoho.com for paid organization/domain accounts.
- Use the Zoho account email as SMTP_USER and an app-specific password in SMTP_PASS if 2FA is enabled.
- BOOKING_EMAIL_TO and BOOKING_EMAIL_FROM can point to the same Zoho mailbox.

Main files:

- app/page.tsx: homepage content, trek packages, FAQ, guide sections, booking CTAs.
- app/globals.css: responsive layout, animation, and visual design.
- app/seo.ts: canonical URLs, hreflang, Open Graph, Twitter card, and robots metadata helpers.
- app/api/reviews/route.ts: server-side Google Places reviews endpoint.
- app/[locale]/page.tsx: localized language routes.
- public/images/: local copies of key images from the existing website.
- scripts/fix-next-static-assets.mjs: post-build asset alias helper for the local Next build.
- scripts/generate-link-preview.mjs: creates the Open Graph/Twitter preview image.
